      "title": "Position Details",
      "description": "Custodial Worker Senior - Las Cruces, New Mexico, United States Why NMSU? Aggie Perks Compensation and Benefits Applicant Resources View Jobs Applicant Login Kiosk mode Custodial Worker Senior 504040 Las Cruces, New Mexico, United States Staff Staff Full-time Closing at: Sep 17 2026 - 23:55 MDT Add to favorites View favorites Department Contact: Oscar Escarcega, 575-646-8077, oescarce@nmsu.edu Internal or External Search: Internal - Open to Regular NMSU employees only (temporary/Term employees not eligible) Advertising Summary: Facilities and Services is looking for a Custodial Worker, Senior to join and support the leadership team! Apply today! Position Details Position Title: Custodial Worker Senior College/Division: Facilities and Services Department: 500695-FS CUSTODIAL SERVICES Location: Las Cruces Offsite Location (if applicable): Target Hourly/Salary Rate: 16.83 Appointment Full-time Equivalency: 1.0 FLSA Status : Non-Exempt Bargaining Unit Announcement: This is a bargaining unit position with American Federation of State, County & Municipal Employees (AFSCME). Contingent Upon Funding: Not Applicable Standard Work Schedule: Shift: Other Shift If Not a Standard Work Schedule: M-F, 6:00am - 2:00pm Job Duties and Responsibilities: Provide custodial cleaning services to campus buildings, classrooms and work areas. This can include classrooms, offices, building entryways, teaching labs, restrooms, and other common areas of campus buildings. Qualifications Required Education and Experience: High School diploma + 1 years of relevant experience, or higher degree. Equivalent Qualifications: Preferred Qualifications: Special Certification/Licensure: Working Conditions and Physical Effort Environment: Work involves almost constant exposure to unusual elements: i.e. extreme temp, toxic chemicals, biohazardous materials, dirt, dust, fumes, smoke, loud noises, other potentially dangerous materials/situations that require safety precaution/protective e