on Agronomy/Soil Fertility Specialist, Assistant Professor (tenure-track, 12-month) position located at the Ag Science Center in Artesia, NM. CES County Program Assistant Remote Locations, New Mexico, United States 310600-ADMIN PRGM GUADALUPE CTY If you are interested in 4H, we have a job for you.  We are searching for a Program Assistant to work with the Cooperative Extension Agent to deliver programming and services to 4-H youth and other constituents.\n\n** This position is located in Guadalupe County, Santa Rosa, NM.** Apply Now First Name (required) 425163a0 Last Name (required) 33e29066 Email (required) 96db57a5 Refer someone to this job Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Diversity & Inclusion New Mexico State University does not discriminate in employment on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, national origin, political affiliation, marital status, disability, genetic information, age, military service, or other non-merit factor. Quick Links About NMSU Contact Us Privacy Policy Search NMSU Copyright © 2026 All Rights Reserved by New Mexico State University - Board of Regents . Candidate Details This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personalize content such as job recommendations, and to analyze our traffic. You consent to our cookies if you click \"I Accept\". If you click on \"I Do Not Accept\", then we will not use cookies but you may have a deteriorated user experience. You can change your settings by clicking on the Settings link on the top right of the device. I do not accept I accept Please choose the location(s)"
